    "body": "### Features\r\n- **Resolver**: edit subscriptions in place; fix stale rule counts after edits/refreshes.\r\n- **Updater**: safer `version.dll` self-update (`.new` staging + atomic swap); clearer error logging.\r\n- **UI**: wider header/main layout, no nav scroll on long labels."
