    "body": "### Features\r\n\r\n- add domain mapping via Chromium `--host-resolver-rules` — map domains to IPs without editing the system hosts file, with subscription support for hosts-format sources and a configurable global rule limit\r\n- add option to open the config page automatically after an in-app update (off by default, in the Other settings tab)\r\n\r\n### Style\r\n\r\n- align updater GUI theme with the config page neutral palette for visual consistency across light/dark mode"
  },
